From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:55:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] clk: sunxi-ng: a733: Take the G2D clock source order from the
 manual

G2D_CLK_REG CLK_SRC_SEL selects 000 = PERI0_300M and 001 = PERI0_400M
in the A733 manual (section 4.1.6.108). The driver has the two swapped,
so at the reset value the clock tree reports g2d at 400 MHz while the
block runs from 300 MHz, and a rate request for 400 MHz selects the
300 MHz source.

Seen on the Radxa Cubie A7S: the same copy through the G2D rotate engine
takes longer on mux value 0 than on mux value 1, by the ratio of 400 to
300 MHz, at two dividers. With PLL_VIDEO1 and PLL_VIDEO2 set to
different rates and then swapped, the copy on mux value 3 follows the
PLL in PLL_VIDEO2_CTRL.

Swap the first two parents. 010 = VIDEO0PLL4X is unchanged. Take the
fourth parent from the video2 PLL (011 = VIDEO2PLL4X), where the driver
has the video1 PLL.

This corrects "clk: sunxi-ng: a733: Add mod clocks support" of the A733
CCU series v6.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: at the reset value the clock tree reports
the 300 MHz source the block runs from, setting either of the first two
parents writes the matching CLK_SRC_SEL value, and on source 3 the
block follows PLL_VIDEO2, not PLL_VIDEO1.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
index 416c7f98aa1b..8f94408b29a1 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
@@ -799,10 +799,10 @@ static SUNXI_CCU_M_HW_WITH_MUX_GATE(di_clk, "di", di_parents, 0xa20,
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(bus_di_clk, "bus-di", ahb_hws, 0xa24, BIT(0), 0);
 
 static const struct clk_hw *g2d_parents[] = {
-	&pll_periph0_400M_clk.hw,
 	&pll_periph0_300M_clk.hw,
+	&pll_periph0_400M_clk.hw,
 	&pll_video0_4x_clk.common.hw,
-	&pll_video1_4x_clk.common.hw,
+	&pll_video2_4x_clk.common.hw,
 };
 static SUNXI_CCU_M_HW_WITH_MUX_GATE(g2d_clk, "g2d", g2d_parents, 0xa40,
 				    0, 5,	/* M */
